                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1][b]Little Old School With a Bit of Something Different[/b][/h1]\n\nYeah this game is for those that liked old games from the past with a twist. The game plays like a old Space Invaders but has a twist with Platform mechanics . The game is very Bullet Hell and can be very challenging. The game has very old school vibrant look and runs pretty slick. The games soundtrack is good enuf to enjoy as you play. The Boss Battles are pretty neat and challenging also with so much going on!\n\nI say if you like old school arcade shooters pick this one up ! \n\n{{Side note also the DEV is a really nice guy and im sure if thier is any issues with the game im sure he will address it ASAP.}}",
